msgid ""
"Check that the camera is not\n"
"\n"
" - opened by another photo <b>application</b>\n"
" - mounted as a <b>filesystem</b> on the desktop\n"
" - in <b>sleep mode</b> to save battery power\n"
msgstr ""
"請檢查相機是否：\n"
"\n"
" - 被其他相片<b>應用程式</b>開啟\n"
" - 以<b>檔案系統</b>掛載於桌面上\n"
" - 為節省電力進入<b>睡眠模式</b>\n"

